  "FAQ": [
    {
      "question": "Which materials are specified?",
      "answer": "The shaft lining is artificial long plush and the insole is artificial short plush. Exact upper composition, outsole and midsole materials are not specified. Include your material requirements when requesting a quotation."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which colors and sizes are offered?",
      "answer": "Khaki, Black and Cream with size labels 35-42. Send quantities for each color and size. Foot measurements and international size conversions are confirmed for the order."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do the boots close?",
      "answer": "These boots have a side zipper and quilted upper panels, as shown in the actual product photos."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can I request samples or customization?",
      "answer": "Send your sample quantity or customization requirements with your color-size mix. Feasibility, charges, packing or logo options and any applicable minimums are confirmed before quotation."
    },
    {
      "question": "How is availability and dispatch confirmed?",
      "answer": "Provide quantities by color and size, destination and requested dispatch date. Per-size availability, packing, payment and dispatch terms are assessed for your order before quotation."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the minimum and quantity prices?",
      "answer": "The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative prices are USD 11.87 for 2-49 pairs, USD 11.08 for 50-99 pairs and USD 10.29 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on the color-size mix, packing and agreed order terms; freight and taxes are confirmed separately."
    }
  ],
